  "description": "A 100% managed, dependency-free (no LiteRT / TFLite runtime, no native tokenizer) port of Google's EmbeddingGemma 2 multimodal embedding family: embeddinggemma-2-text-270m, embeddinggemma-2-text-vision-440m and embeddinggemma-2-740m. Loads the official LiteRT-LM (.litertlm) bundles and runs the SentencePiece tokenizer, the int4 text encoder, the int8 vision encoder and the audio encoder in pure SIMD-vectorized C#.",
